@template shy

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- Um. You weren't on shift. Are you... all right?

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- I heard about the Chief. I... I could walk down with you. Mornings. If you want.   #warm

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- I don't want you to go. Sorry. That's all. I just don't.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- I'll be at breakfast early. Come with me? Then the shift. Please.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- You were on shift. I saw. I'm... really glad.   #warm

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- I'll come to the shuttle bay tomorrow. To wave. I'm not good at goodbyes.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Bye, {nick}. Thank you for talking to me. Most people don't.   #warm
